{"4250680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AGX GP", "steam_appid": 4250680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARD - FAST - FUTURISTIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AGX, you unleash your Anti‑Gravity vehicle’s Xtreme abilities to build blistering speed, win races, and conquer varied challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/9b531f0932305fb4128afde0f96e392d.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/9b531f0932305fb4128afde0f96e392d.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy 5 Xtreme vehicle abilities — designed to maximise your speed, demand precision, and reward player skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLOW</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/ab95fd11a1860f2359cef9a638767daa.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/ab95fd11a1860f2359cef9a638767daa.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ adrenaline‑fueled, highly replayable tracks — with deceptively simple mechanics that immerse you into a true competitive “flow state.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEPTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/c1e5cfe39dbc5181bf9d63bdf7f160ec.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/c1e5cfe39dbc5181bf9d63bdf7f160ec.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 125+ challenges across 7 diverse game modes in 3 different speed classes creating more than 375 events — From full-scale Racing Championships to competitive skill based trials, every event pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/0dbf545b8c02d835c653d8d038f5b113.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/0dbf545b8c02d835c653d8d038f5b113.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across distinct locations — from futuristic Earth to the lunar frontier — wrapped in a clean, crisp visual design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive Customisation options for the Vehicle, UI and Track Style! Full Photo-mode, Online Leaderboards and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for Native 4K at 120 fps on Recommend Spec PC. (Smooth 60 fps on Steam Deck.) </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARD - FAST - FUTURISTIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AGX, you unleash your Anti‑Gravity vehicle’s Xtreme abilities to build blistering speed, win races, and conquer varied challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SP